        <mxCell id="oV0UyKTJWNAnQeJ7lQhW-31" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;ul&gt;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;View Visual Pipeline Board:&lt;/b&gt; available to all five roles, with role-based project visibility.&lt;/li&gt;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reorder Projects Within Current Phase:&lt;/b&gt; Sales Representative, Sales Manager, Executive Manager and Project Manager; System Administrator is read-only.&lt;/li&gt;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Request Phase Sign-off:&lt;/b&gt; Sales Representative handles applicable Sales phases; Project Manager handles applicable delivery phases. Phase 3 sign-off is raised automatically when its execution is completed.&lt;/li&gt;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Approve Phase Sign-off:&lt;/b&gt; Sales Manager, Executive Manager and System Administrator may approve Phase 1-3 requests; no user may approve their own request.&lt;/li&gt;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Approve Phase 4 Sign-off:&lt;/b&gt; Executive Manager only.&lt;/li&gt;      &lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="480" x="820" y="-1070" as="geometry" />
